// Embeds the application icon into the executable itself, which is what
// Explorer, the taskbar and Alt-Tab read. Qt's setWindowIcon() only affects
// the running window, so both are needed.
// ID 1 (IDI_ICON1): Windows shows the numerically lowest icon resource as the
// file's icon, so this must stay the first one declared.
1 ICON "icons/app_icon.ico"
